OL,3,GNEWSACity's only residential tower
OL,4,Ablock to be demolished
OL,5,
OL,6,FA city's only residential tower block
OL,7,Fis to be demolished after plans to
OL,8,Freplace it with affordable homes were
OL,9,Ffinally approved.
OL,11,FClapham Court on Alvin Street,
OL,12,FGloucester, houses 80 one-bedroom
OL,13,Fflats, mainly for people over 55, but
OL,14,Fthere is currently only one resident
OL,15,Fliving there.
OL,17,FGloucester City Council's planning
OL,18,Fcommittee granted permission on Tuesday
OL,19,Ffor Gloucester City Homes' plans to
OL,20,Freplace the 11-storey building with 34
OL,21,Fhomes and a replacement pharmacy.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
