OL,3,GNEWSACity's only residential tower
OL,4,Ablock to be demolished
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith only 21 parking spaces planned,
OL,7,FJeremy Hilton, councillor for Kingsholm
OL,8,Fand Wotton, who was ousted as council
OL,9,Fleader last month, said the lack of
OL,10,Fparking risked placing "an
OL,11,Funsustainable strain on neighbouring
OL,12,Froads".
